[{"client_msg_id":"AFD03B03-7F6B-4C2A-B48E-F0578E50C8C7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"バテたので記事はやる気が復活したらやる","ts":"1627026662.220300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zw0x/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91D04431-AFDE-4B2C-BCD1-8DA8268CF0E7","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"結局一日かかってしまった","ts":"1627026650.219900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qF5c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b484d353-8936-4374-bebf-60c1501d504d","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"websocket.Connをwrapして、Writerを実装してそこでバッファリングするようにして動いた","ts":"1627024202.219600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LjQq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ecb628d-c274-4b68-aa95-f0eeefe67d18","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"UTF-8の問題","ts":"1627021599.217500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qo5X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09d275c4-a475-412b-85c7-9662ec29cca0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"issueを軽く漁ってみたけど、ないっぽいですね","ts":"1627021587.217200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eAe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a22ea02-ec29-404c-9669-9a1475d05d8c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"だとすればwebsocket.Conn.Writeのコメントに「broken UTF-8書くと問題が起こるから普通のio.Writerとは違うよ」みたいな注意書きが足りてない、可能性もありますが。","ts":"1627021427.216900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z0ime"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67be7341-10d9-4cbd-ade3-012c0585286b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"です","ts":"1627021418.216600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rm=Y0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96942ee6-be95-4771-ae01-7ecbcb5a8cf5","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; いえwebsocket.Conn.Writeの中で、msgをparseして、末尾がinvalidなUTF-8ならすぐには送らないで次のmsgの先頭にくっつけて送る、です。\nあー、websocket.Connを直すって話ですか？","ts":"1627021415.216400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CO8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3bd896b-49b4-4994-af10-6bd94b4861d2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"このくらいのことはすでに議論されてそう。","ts":"1627021344.215100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1627021349.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LsD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67e6d937-bf2c-42fc-a1a4-eaa2ae2ca324","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただ","ts":"1627021337.214800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T40sZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e97fb5e3-5b0f-4b9b-8158-6ffe95baacd3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いえwebsocket.Conn.Writeの中で、msgをparseして、末尾がinvalidなUTF-8ならすぐには送らないで次のmsgの先頭にくっつけて送る、です。","ts":"1627021335.214600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hexd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76a66bd2-42c5-4d37-9db0-7a03f5a30057","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"websocket.Conn をwrapしてio.Copyを使う、というイメージですか？","ts":"1627021210.213500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ux9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d0e8a85-d07a-47b3-a5f5-04d2a86ffc51","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たぶんwebsocket.Connレベルでバッファリング\u0026amp;UTF-8としてcheckするのが良いとは思います。","ts":"1627021145.213100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gcz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6452c3b3-0475-45fc-aadd-53a0ea9e415e","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; で、x/net/websocket直すのメンドイよね、ということであれば、ReadString\u0026amp;WriteStringで文字(UTF-8)が壊れないように送るって感じでしょうか。\nちょっとやってみます","ts":"1627021004.212100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ezvNH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5551f025-3829-41e0-beb0-1c3baf3b646f","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに Copy はあくまでも読み取ったデータを書き込むだけの役割なので、そこにUTF-8が壊れているかどうかを確認させるのはおかしいですね","ts":"1627020982.211800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xR3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1951e35b-c48a-467e-94a9-6019eb1a38cf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":rikai:","ts":"1627020934.210900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zqdx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a4e2c4d-622a-40f3-8bec-0662483df133","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、x/net/websocket直すのメンドイよね、ということであれば、ReadString\u0026amp;WriteStringで文字(UTF-8)が壊れないように送るって感じでしょうか。","ts":"1627020925.210700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1627020937.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OKu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9de1c4fe-c98e-4128-b753-3a93532e0a19","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なぜならGoのio.Writerである以上、UTF-8を切ってはいけないという制限はないですから。","ts":"1627020874.209800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A6H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"237f2ed8-5d2c-4d8b-a11d-1a663c44d019","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"たしかに","ts":"1627020860.209500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"06P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc54659-329f-47e9-a684-edab8a314fa3","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1627020844.209000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oUIpr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be064496-7635-4856-ac9c-ac2a153d6066","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なので一番正しいのはこいつか、その先のw.Writeがバッファリングして、渡されたmsgをうまく切るのが正しい。\u003chttps://cs.opensource.google/go/x/net/+/853a4619:websocket/websocket.go;l=222-232\u003e","ts":"1627020798.208300","attachments":[{"fallback":"Search and explore code","id":1,"text":"Search and explore code","blocks":null,"service_name":"cs.opensource.google","service_icon":"https://www.gstatic.com/devopsconsole/images/oss/favicons/oss-96x96.png","from_url":"https://cs.opensource.google/go/x/net/+/853a4619:websocket/websocket.go;l=222-232","original_url":"https://cs.opensource.google/go/x/net/+/853a4619:websocket/websocket.go;l=222-232"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cZvD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"981d02e8-50ef-4847-8f97-d3d588227d68","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1627020793.208100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"upsO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68b3cf2f-68b8-4673-b97f-7458539f29ce","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そそ","ts":"1627020785.207600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lzM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58fd0554-39ad-4f29-a589-80fc0c6897c0","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"そもそも、wsの仕様としてinvalidなUTF-8が来たら切断って名言してありますが、そこはclientでよしなにやるべきってことですか？\n\u003chttps://triple-underscore.github.io/RFC6455-ja.html\u003e","ts":"1627020778.207300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7RG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c21d4ac6-1547-4a3c-81c1-cdc697571601","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"webscoket.Connか","ts":"1627020671.205900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N5wtq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ab1c17a-1c57-48dd-9952-5158e9081dd0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ws.Clientっていうラッパーなのかもしれないけど、そいつの実装がおかしいってだけだから","ts":"1627020660.205600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GQj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66867c4c-e471-408e-be3a-81e60cc11d7c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやそれは関係ないでしょ","ts":"1627020642.204900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NiATz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24cf38e5-19a6-48d9-9173-505224bbdb94","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"clientはjsのwebsocketなのでGoではないですね","ts":"1627020618.204600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=sp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bebb9144-9476-4fbf-ad51-499d98e4145a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もしも本当にws.ClientのWriteが半端というか送りかけのUTF-8を受け取れないのだとすれば、それはws.Clientがio.Writerの要件を満たしてないんですよね。","ts":"1627020580.204100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gm7t/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebe84eec-abc4-4b50-b499-2f061feac8e8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1627020559.203600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ij+A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6aa44bc-1a58-45f7-be5b-9cd1c2a34037","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"bufioかませてReadStringして、io.WriteString(ws.Client, s)するとか","ts":"1627020519.202800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ztF+R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad1f23ce-d08e-424e-9f52-266171d26e15","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"んー、そうなるとどう対処するのが正しいですか？","ts":"1627020496.202100","edited":{"user":"UDDCM376D","ts":"1627020501.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original"