03chttps://github.com/skanehira/rtty|skanehira/rtty\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1620638517}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c9b9229-f62f-4eb8-bf54-36f4498df40e","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"次は、deleteもff対応させたい","ts":"1627018292.193000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Me="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3148177-f06e-492b-8aac-74e78f8e5719","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"rusmo fuzzyfinder対応完了!\n\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/rusmo\u003e","ts":"1627018254.192200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"hashue/rusmo","id":1,"title":"hashue/rusmo","text":"assist your memo life to improve your productivity. ","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"3","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UDDCM376D","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kZYVr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72be3e11-1de3-44c6-85cb-a3b8287dc2c1","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"おお、ncurses、なるほど！　具体性を帯び始めましたね　読んでみます！ありがとうございます","ts":"1626998410.190700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DcFp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85a11a26-7b9f-42e3-9d4e-f91e19662906","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"このissueに辿りついたSO見直したら、macOSのncursesが古いのか、tmuxターミナルに関する情報が足りてないのが悪いらしいらしいですね。リンク先に解決方法載ってました\nもし問題がmacOSの話であればですけど。\n\u003chttps://stackoverflow.com/a/68456561/12901910\u003e","ts":"1626997791.189700","attachments":[{"fallback":"Stack Overflow: Backspace not working in tmux command prompt","id":1,"title":"Backspace not working in tmux command prompt","title_link":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68456561/12901910","text":"I'm having trouble with my Backspace key on the tmux command prompt. The backspace deletes previous characters (as expected) within tmux but not on the tmux command prompt. For example, \u0026lt;PREFI...","thumb_url":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon@2.png?v=73d79a89bded","blocks":null,"service_name":"Stack Overflow","service_icon":"https://cdn.sstatic.net/Sites/stackoverflow/Img/apple-touch-icon.png?v=c78bd457575a","thumb_width":316,"thumb_height":316,"from_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68456561/12901910","original_url":"https://stackoverflow.com/a/68456561/12901910"}],"edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1626997818.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HvBud"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85294ba1-2ab0-4d77-b5aa-33d8e73a11ec","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"おーありがとうございます　同じ問題の人いるんだ！\n確かにTERM自体を変えるアプローチで問題なく動きそうですね\nただ気になるのは、$TERM=alacrityでもtmuxでも、過去には起きていなかった動作なので、できれば直接の原因を知りたいところではありますね","ts":"1626997514.188200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dz64"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84fd337b-60ee-4a4f-a8b7-4e4a218cd248","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"これですね\n\u0026gt; changed from:\n\u0026gt;  set -g default-terminal \"tmux-256color\"\n\u0026gt;  to:\n\u0026gt;  set -g default-terminal \"xterm-256color\"\n\u0026gt; This solved the problem. Removing this line altogether also worked but it seemed better to be explicit.\n\u003chttps://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/321\u003e","ts":"1626997180.186600","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/321|#321 Backspace bad behaviour\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tmux/tmux/issues/321|#321 Backspace bad behaviour\u003e","text":"Backspace doesn't behave as it should. If two characters are typed, and backspace is pressed let's say ten times, every backspace press will print a space, but the limit of the spaces printed will be two and the error bell will ring in the rest of the eight times. If five characters are typed the limit will be five and so on.  \nSetup:\n\n• Tmux version: 2.1-1\n• Cygwin 64 on Windows 7 x64\n• Mintty 2.2.3\n\nTried with different terminal models in Mintty (xterm, xterm-256, vt220...) but didn't make a difference: the behavior of the key is correct in the terminal until I enter in a tmux session.  \nCtrl-H nor Ctrl-V behave like backspace, and tried enabling the option to send Ctrl-H in every backspace in Mintty options, but didn't make a difference either.\n\nCurrent tmux.conf:\n\n```\n#set -g default-terminal \"xterm-256-color\"\n\n# remap prefix from 'C-b' to 'C-a'\nunbind C-b\nset-option -g prefix C-a\nbind-key C-a send-prefix\n\n# split panes using | and -\nbind | split-window -h\nbind - split-window -v\nunbind '\"'\nunbind %\n\n# switch panes using Alt-arrow without prefix\nbind -n M-h select-pane -L\nbind -n M-l select-pane -R\nbind -n M-k select-pane -U\nbind -n M-j select-pane -D\n\n# Enable mouse control (clickable windows, panes, resizable panes)\nset -g mouse on\n\n```","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"6","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tmux/tmux|tmux/tmux\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1456942186}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O18P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6742052b-43d5-40e6-a56a-849bc043549a","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"それが、ターミナルエミュレータを変えたら$TERMも変化するので、それでxtermになったときだけ通常通りで、それ以外、その状態でtmuxを起動などすると$TERMが変化して、再現するという感じでして…；\nつまり例え大丈夫なターミナルエミュレータを選んでも、このままではtmuxが使えない状態ですね","ts":"1626996877.185800","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1626996894.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pnPbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53fe3237-8172-4471-9d62-86d664ac3280","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"zﾅﾝﾄｶが関係なさそうならターミナルエミュレータを入れ直してみたら治ったりしませんかね\nターミナルの設定ファイルが壊れてるとかで","ts":"1626992367.184200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aTzI8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2760093-79e7-4098-8977-45236485c43e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"覚えてないけど似たようなことなったことありますね","ts":"1626992257.182100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+iRb7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a94e2364-0382-4813-9548-a3609fcd11d7","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"最悪HOMEのファイル全部消して対応かなあ","ts":"1626990914.181700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xgu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b561f294-7723-4a65-a6ca-5aea454fcd40","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"この症状自体はMacが突然電源切れた直後から起こるようになっていて、心当たりのある処理がないんです","ts":"1626990865.181300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"08aA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f3dfe0e-1029-4fe6-b3d8-4bf7e56241eb","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"$ vim|\nというカーソル状態からバックスペースを3回押すと\n$ vim   |\nと、カーソルが前に3つ動いて、このままエンター押すとvimという文字列は消えていて、単に何も入れずにエンター押したのと同等になる\nという症状に悩まされていて、この問題はtmuxとalacurittyという$TERMのとき再現して、xterm-256colorの場合は再現しない\nということをだいぶ前に書いたんですが\nこれ、システム領域の問題だと思っていたら、ユーザ領域の問題だったっぽくて、Timemachineでバックアップ取ってマシン変えても再現しちゃいました；\n.zshrc, .zprofile, .zenvなどは適宜コメントアウトして見てみたんですが、関係なかったっぽいです\nこの症状に心当たりのある方はいらっしゃいませんか…つらい…","ts":"1626990658.180600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gFi"}]}]
